  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Use-after-free on reallocated remote forwarding data\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-73282.patch: pass an index-based\n       rfwd_confirm_ctx to client_register_global_confirm() instead of a\n       pointer into the options.remote_forwards array, so that a remote\n       forwarding added over the local multiplexing socket cannot leave\n       ssh_confirm_remote_forward() holding a pointer invalidated by the\n       array reallocation, in ssh.c\n     - CVE-2026-73282",
